Ia ada di bahagian belakang.

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:43.850
Syukurlah kami jumpa awak sebelum subuh.

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:47.200
Hampir selesai.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.230
Selesai.

